===Etymology===
Named for [[Montezuma]] or {{w|Moctezuma II}} ({{circa2|1466|short=yes}} – 1520), the last [[Aztec]] ruler before the empire was conquered by the [[Spanish#Noun|Spanish]]. The condition is seen as “[[retribution]]” for the [[slaughter]] and [[enslavement]] of the Aztec people by Spanish [[conquistador]] {{w|Hernán Cortés}} on 13 August 1521.

